              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "twRrB",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Two columns. On the left, where and with whom: Hermes, the rooms, and the open room’s team as folded rows. On the right, the conversation takes all the remaining width.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "p7ilNg",
          "name": "Solves",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "kKQ7X",
              "name": "PanelCaption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "SOLVES",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "uYbyn",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The thread goes from about 390px of text to 720px: messages at body size, names never truncated, no fixed from and to columns.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "R4HwI7",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "What needs you is gathered in one strip at the top of the room, each line with its action. A message’s delivery state goes from four places today (row tag, rail count, queue bar, composer hint) to two: the tag on the message and a count on the agent it waits for.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "LSWUa",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The room’s state and its stop sit with the room, not in the page header. How the room runs is one ghost button away, not a permanent block.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "M1OYtw",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The right rail no longer changes meaning between Hermes and a room: there is no right rail.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "olZfH",
          "name": "Costs",
          "width": "fill_container",
